{"overview":"بر روی زمین، فاجعه‌ای باعث تغییر و تنوع گونه‌های مختلف شد؛ نژاد برتر زنده ماند و نژادهای ضعیف‌تر منقرض شدند. در این شرایط، لوو فنگ از صاحب ستاره یونمو ارث برد و به یکی از سه نیروی برتر زمین تبدیل شد. او در نبرد با هیولای غول‌پیکری که خود را بلعیده بود، گوشت خود را از دست داد اما سپس گوشت آن هیولا را به‌دست آورد؛ در این گوشت، بدن انسانی شکل گرفت. بعدها، او از زمین خارج شد و به سوی کیهان حرکت کرد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"On the Earth, a catastrophe triggered the variation of all kinds of species. The superior survived and the inferior were extinct. Under this circumstance, Luo Feng inherited from the owner of Yunmo Star and became one of the three strongest people on the Earth. He lost his flesh during the fight against giant swallowed monster but then he took the flesh of the monster. In the flesh, he developed a human body. Later, he stepped out of the Earth and headed to the universe.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":260,"y":2020,"poster":"/oGvGNJzJ36d6RIknuJa2c1NutFC.jpg"}],"episodes":260,"crew":["邵官华","沈乐平","我吃西红柿"],"crew_en":["邵官华","Robin Shen","Wo Chi Xihongshi"],"countries":["CN"],"cast":[{"name":"赵乾景","role":"罗峰","photo":"/6QRgZZZhwee5md1W5kgeCEScvQI.jpg","en":"Zhao Qianjing"},{"name":"Xie Ying","role":"徐 欣","photo":"/dQ1u9rUbPGN2wUO0BqASO7VER2r.jpg"},{"name":"张晔","role":"姬青","photo":"/dSQtLie4qFNdHLwdF02LCjLfTj9.jpg"},{"name":"赵梓涵","role":"罗洪国","photo":"/xIKTjzUkCxIFmP5EG6Zg0RYduym.jpg"},{"name":"张欣","role":"(voice)","photo":"/vkxwijWjFmkQo7sSOsKCsPTfE6a.jpg","en":"Zhang Xin"},{"name":"Wang Xiaobing","role":"(voice)","photo":"/qOPU3V05h5w2eQ6yrAEVmTKrPyw.jpg"},{"name":"Zhihao Su","role":"(voice)","photo":"/n28dKqctpmZyK0ee6veBK71nVYk.jpg"},{"name":"张彬彬","role":"(voice)","photo":"/8LvvrOhj4zxPuYgpPJ9HWyJzf4a.jpg","en":"Vin Zhang"},{"name":"李婵妃","role":"(voice)","photo":"/9lPXNOqWemS1gilUTsRQcyG8wnX.jpg","en":"Li Chanfei"},{"name":"吴磊","role":"(voice)","photo":"/z1Aw5fyYAND8EOth